      },
      "message": "fix(motion): trochoidal slot maps measure()'s stock error to a named refusal\n\n#783 made quality::measure return Result<PathQuality, StockError>; the\ntrochoidal slot (#563/#778) still read its fields directly, so main\nstopped compiling once both merged. Both call sites now go through one\ngauge closure that maps the error into the generator's named GenError,\nwith the wording the stock() closure already uses.\n\nFixes #844\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
