      "message": "fix(motion): the lifted-return law reads the stock through Stock, not Dexel\n\nThe trochoid's lifted_cut still took a raw Dexel, but since #783 its stock\ncomes from quality::stock_for as a Stock. It now walks the stock with\nStock::subtract_flat and reads it through Columns. A stock the reading\ncannot serve is a named refusal, never a pass.\n\nRefs #844\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
