      "message": "fix(motion): the trochoidal slot seeds its path under the approach law\n\nThe #697 approach law (every mill generator seeding X0 Y0 on the clearance\nplane uses PathBuilder::approached) landed beside the trochoid, whose\nfinish() still used PathBuilder::new. Its first move is already a rapid, so\nthe path is unchanged; origin_approach's sweep is green again.\n\nRefs #844\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
